1 polymer     man 'Tyrosine-protein kinase Fgr' 20306.855 1  2.7.10.2 A256R ? 
;Human Fgr SH3, SH2 and linker domains; the wild-type linker residue A256 was mutated to R256. N-terminal serine residue originates from Sumo tag Ulp1 cleavage. Residue C131 was covalently modified with beta mercaptoethanol reducing agent during the purification process.
